<h2>About All Faiths On Fire</h2>
<hr />

<p>We are not a church. We are not a denomination. We are a movement.</p>

<p><strong>All Faiths On Fire</strong> is a collaborative scripture project — a living book written by the dreamers, the burden-bearers, and the kind. We believe that wisdom belongs to no single tradition, and that the sacred text of humanity is still being written.</p>

<h3>What We Believe</h3>
<p>We believe in the power of story. In the truth that lives in parables. In the courage of those who stood against injustice and the redemption available to all who seek it.</p>

<p>We draw from the wells of every faith tradition — not to dilute them, but to honor the common threads of compassion, justice, and love that run through all of them.</p>

<h3>How This Works</h3>
<p>This scripture is written together. Through our Discord community, members submit verses, chapters, and wisdom. Moderators review submissions, and accepted contributions become part of the living text.</p>

<p>There is no pope here. No hierarchy of holiness. Just seekers sharing what they've found.</p>

<h3>Join Us</h3>
<p>If you feel the fire — if you've seen the sacred in unexpected places — you belong here. Join us on Discord and help write the Book as it should have been written.</p>

